OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader convicted of fraud
OL,4,Ato be replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader who was convicted of
OL,7,Ffraud and tax evasion will be replaced
OL,8,Fat a meeting on Monday, it has been
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FJason Zadrozny was found guilty of
OL,12,Fsetting up a fake heritage group to
OL,13,Fdefraud Nottinghamshire County Council
OL,14,Fout of thousands of pounds, and failing
OL,15,Fto pay tax on the income from four
OL,16,Frental properties.
OL,18,FThe 46-year-old, of Stanton Hill,
OL,19,Fannounced his resignation as leader of
OL,20,FAshfield District Council on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
