OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader convicted of fraud
OL,4,Ato be replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe district council said a new leader
OL,7,Fwould be appointed at the next full
OL,8,Fcouncil meeting, scheduled for Monday.
